/-!
# The irrelevant-parameter residue and homogeneous lifts

The positive-degree parameter submodule is restricted to the generic
coefficient field.  Parameter multiplication in the quotient reduces to
constant multiplication, which turns a finite homogeneous parameter-spanning
family into a finite-dimensional residue space and a basis with homogeneous
lifts.
-/

noncomputable section

