/-!
# Grading the trusted generic reduction basis

This module identifies each trusted homogeneous quotient submodule with the
span of the reduction-basis vectors having the corresponding degree. It then
packages those vectors as an explicit basis of the homogeneous submodule.
-/

noncomputable section

open scoped BigOperators

open SimplicialSphereAnisotropicity.Simplicial SimplicialSphereAnisotropicity.Topology
